Scriptname SonOfAClumsyWeapon extends MCM_ConfigBase
{ Son of a! - Clumsy Weapon Slipping Mod -- MCM registration.

  Intentionally empty. Extending MCM Helper's MCM_ConfigBase is what registers
  this mod with SkyUI and makes the menu appear; MCM Helper matches this script's
  name to Data\MCM\Config\SonOfAClumsyWeapon\config.json and renders it. All the
  actual gameplay lives in _SoaClumsyController, which is attached to the same
  quest. }
